<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Club Med.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Club Med.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Product (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Club Mediterranee, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE			ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A    100.0 PCT OF REF PRICE  2.68 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> CALL B    110.0 PCT OF REF PRICE  2.31 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> CALL C    110.0 PCT OF REF PRICE  2.98 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> PAYDATE 29.NOV.96     LISTING PARIS     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  AVERAGE PRICE OF SHARES ON THE PARIS SE</p>
<p> NOTES	     TRANCHES A AND B MATURE 20.NOV.98, TRANCHE C</p>
<p>		     MATURES 22.NOV.99</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
